l advice, or a guarantee of rankings, traffic, leads, revenue, or other business outcomes.</p>\n<h2>Customer responsibilities</h2>\n<p>You are responsible for providing accurate information, completing required intake steps, maintaining appropriate backups, and deciding whether to implement any recommendation. Never send passwords through the contact or intake forms.</p>\n<h2>Payment and delivery</h2>\n<p>Payment is due at checkout. Downloadable products are delivered electronically. Audit delivery timelines begin after both payment and the required intake information are complete. Communicated delays or missing customer information may extend the delivery date.</p>\n<h2>Intellectual property</h2>\n<p>Scrolly SEO materials are licensed to the purchaser for their own internal business use. They may not be resold, republished, shared publicly, or distributed as templates or training materials without written permission.</p>\n<h2>Accuracy and limitations</h2>\n<p>Search platforms, rankings, competitors, traffic, and AI systems change. Findings are based on information reasonably available at the time of analysis. Recommendations are educational and strategic, and specific results are not guaranteed.</p>\n<h2>Governing law</h2>\n<p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.</p>\n<h2>Questions</h2>\n<p>Use the form below for questions about these terms or a purchase.</p>\n<p class=\"note\"><strong>Professional review recommended:</strong> These terms are a plain-language operational draft and should be reviewed by a qualified Texas attorney before relying on them as final legal advice.</p>\n<div class=\"contact-box\">\n<h2>Send a message</h2>\n<p>Use this form for questions, accessibility assistance, privacy requests, or order support.</p>\n<div data-test='contact-form'\n\t\t\tid='contact-form-65-1'\n\t\t\tclass='jetpack-contact-form-container '\n\t\t\tdata-wp-interactive='jetpack/form' data-wp-context='{\"fo